{"id":"vol9-05","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-05/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":304.04,"segments":[{"start":24.37,"end":27.71,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to five.","words":[["Now",24.37,24.63],["listen",24.63,24.97],["carefully",24.97,25.43],["and",25.43,25.77],["answer",25.77,26.09],["questions",26.09,26.65],["one",26.65,27.03],["to",27.03,27.25],["five.",27.25,27.71]]},{"start":31.16,"end":32.44,"text":"Hello, can I help you?","words":[["Hello,",31.16,31.5],["can",31.82,31.98],["I",31.98,32.08],["help",32.08,32.24],["you?",32.24,32.44]]},{"start":32.74,"end":33.1,"text":"Hi.","words":[["Hi.",32.74,33.1]]},{"start":33.78,"end":38.74,"text":"I'm still a student, but I've done a bit of research into the tea company you work for,","words":[["I'm",33.78,34.12],["still",34.12,34.34],["a",34.34,34.5],["student,",34.5,34.88],["but",34.88,35.32],["I've",35.32,35.86],["done",35.86,36.0],["a",36.0,36.14],["bit",36.14,36.22],["of",36.22,36.38],["research",36.38,36.76],["into",36.76,37.24],["the",37.24,37.46],["tea",37.46,37.66],["company",37.66,38.02],["you",38.02,38.26],["work",38.26,38.46],["for,",38.46,38.74]]},{"start":38.98,"end":43.4,"text":"and I have a few questions about the tea taster's jobs you have advertised.","words":[["and",38.98,39.46],["I",39.46,39.56],["have",39.56,39.64],["a",39.64,39.76],["few",39.76,39.88],["questions",39.88,40.36],["about",40.36,40.92],["the",40.92,41.12],["tea",41.12,41.4],["taster's",41.4,42.04],["jobs",42.04,42.32],["you",42.32,42.66],["have",42.66,42.88],["advertised.",42.88,43.4]]},{"start":43.88,"end":45.7,"text":"Well, that's actually what I do.","words":[["Well,",43.88,44.16],["that's",44.28,44.72],["actually",44.72,45.1],["what",45.1,45.34],["I",45.34,45.48],["do.",45.48,45.7]]},{"start":46.28,"end":50.84,"text":"Would you like me to tell you a bit about what it's like being a trainee tea taster?","words":[["Would",46.28,46.46],["you",46.46,46.62],["like",46.62,46.82],["me",46.82,47.02],["to",47.02,47.18],["tell",47.18,47.4],["you",47.4,47.58],["a",47.58,47.72],["bit",47.72,47.84],["about",47.84,48.22],["what",48.22,48.5],["it's",48.5,48.78],["like",48.78,49.02],["being",49.02,49.5],["a",49.5,49.7],["trainee",49.7,50.06],["tea",50.06,50.44],["taster?",50.44,50.84]]},{"start":51.1,"end":51.74,"text":"Yes, please.","words":[["Yes,",51.1,51.38],["please.",51.48,51.74]]},{"start":51.74,"end":57.94,"text":"Well, initially, even though there's some time spent in meetings at our office, a trainee","words":[["Well,",51.74,52.52],["initially,",53.0,53.4],["even",53.92,54.14],["though",54.14,54.42],["there's",54.42,54.74],["some",54.74,54.94],["time",54.94,55.3],["spent",55.3,55.58],["in",55.58,55.84],["meetings",55.84,56.18],["at",56.18,56.56],["our",56.56,56.72],["office,",56.72,57.04],["a",57.52,57.66],["trainee",57.66,57.94]]},{"start":57.94,"end":63.18,"text":"is based in our lab, for most of their time, being trained how to do the tasting.","words":[["is",57.94,58.28],["based",58.28,58.56],["in",58.56,58.84],["our",58.84,59.0],["lab,",59.0,59.46],["for",59.7,59.84],["most",59.84,60.06],["of",60.06,60.22],["their",60.22,60.36],["time,",60.36,60.72],["being",61.02,61.22],["trained",61.22,61.68],["how",61.68,62.18],["to",62.18,62.38],["do",62.38,62.62],["the",62.62,62.8],["tasting.",62.8,63.18]]},{"start":63.54,"end":70.5,"text":"Right. How do you actually learn how to taste tea? Do you use a special kind of cup?","words":[["Right.",63.54,63.86],["How",64.54,65.0],["do",65.0,65.16],["you",65.16,65.3],["actually",65.3,65.6],["learn",65.6,66.16],["how",66.16,66.64],["to",66.64,66.84],["taste",66.84,67.3],["tea?",67.3,67.78],["Do",68.42,68.68],["you",68.68,68.96],["use",68.96,69.32],["a",69.32,69.46],["special",69.46,69.8],["kind",69.8,70.1],["of",70.1,70.26],["cup?",70.26,70.5]]},{"start":70.98,"end":77.02,"text":"No. Rather than that, or even a glass, to do the tasting, we sip it from a spoon.","words":[["No.",70.98,71.3],["Rather",71.7,72.14],["than",7