fy I heard it was","words":[["remembered",119.98,120.3],["them",120.3,120.56],["all",120.56,120.78],["I",120.78,121.2],["can",121.2,121.36],["imagine",121.36,121.74],["so",121.74,123.28],["how",123.28,123.66],["long",123.66,123.86],["before",123.86,124.12],["I",124.12,124.32],["qualify",124.32,124.78],["I",124.78,125.7],["heard",125.7,125.96],["it",125.96,126.06],["was",126.06,126.18]]},{"start":126.18,"end":131.46,"text":"seven years is that right well it used to be but we've speeded things up a","words":[["seven",126.18,126.52],["years",126.52,127.04],["is",127.04,127.52],["that",127.52,127.66],["right",127.66,127.92],["well",127.92,128.76],["it",128.76,129.1],["used",129.1,129.38],["to",129.38,129.6],["be",129.6,129.82],["but",129.82,130.08],["we've",130.08,130.36],["speeded",130.36,130.86],["things",130.86,131.04],["up",131.04,131.32],["a",131.32,131.46]]},{"start":131.46,"end":136.52,"text":"bit so now it only takes five that's two years less than before which is quite","words":[["bit",131.46,131.64],["so",131.64,131.96],["now",131.96,132.22],["it",132.22,132.44],["only",132.44,132.7],["takes",132.7,133.04],["five",133.04,133.44],["that's",133.44,134.32],["two",134.32,134.52],["years",134.52,134.82],["less",134.82,135.14],["than",135.14,135.4],["before",135.4,135.7],["which",135.7,136.04],["is",136.04,136.24],["quite",136.24,136.52]]},{"start":136.52,"end":145.68,"text":"significant really right I see before you hear the rest of the conversation you","words":[["significant",136.52,137.02],["really",137.02,137.46],["right",137.46,138.14],["I",138.14,138.78],["see",138.78,139.06],["before",139.06,140.42],["you",143.2,143.4],["hear",143.4,143.68],["the",143.68,143.84],["rest",143.84,144.08],["of",144.08,144.2],["the",144.2,144.28],["conversation",144.28,144.8],["you",144.8,145.68]]},{"start":145.68,"end":175.75,"text":"have some time to look at questions six to ten now listen and answer questions","words":[["have",145.68,145.86],["some",145.86,146.06],["time",146.